# The Gilded Mimic's economy, in plain GlassBox. The units are declared in inn.inn.
# Ale, Stew, Provisions, Tonic, HotWater and Mushrooms are global: the inn's stores, kept in its
# account with Gold. Night is set by the phases (1 while the doors are open).

# The keg rack taps a barrel when the bar runs low; every mug costs the inn a little gold.
unitRule tap
    appliesTo kegs
    rate 2
    global Night atLeast 1
    global Ale less 12
    global Gold in 0.6
    global Ale out 1
end

# The larder buys provisions from the traders upstairs, a few at a time.
unitRule restock
    appliesTo larder
    rate 4
    global Provisions less 8
    global Gold in 1.5
    global Provisions out 3
end

# The hearth turns provisions into stew while the doors are open, and warms the rooms nearby.
unitRule cook
    appliesTo hearth
    rate 3
    global Night atLeast 1
    global Stew less 10
    global Provisions in 1
    global Stew out 2
    map Heat out 4 radius 2
    map Noise out 0.5
end

# A hearth keeps some warmth even when it is not cooking.
unitRule embers
    appliesTo hearth
    map Heat out 1 radius 1
end

# The washtub's scullion scrubs the floors around it, for a small wage.
unitRule scrub
    appliesTo washtub
    global Night atLeast 1
    global Gold in 0.05
    map Dirt in 3 radius 2
end

# ---------- decor: cheer, hush and damp ----------

# A candle stand: cheer and a little warmth round it, always.
unitRule glow
    appliesTo candles
    map Cheer out 0.6 radius 1
    map Heat out 0.2
end

# A guild banner: a little cheer, further.
unitRule flutter
    appliesTo banner
    map Cheer out 0.3 radius 2
end

# Trophies and a hoard: something to point at.
unitRule boast
    appliesTo trophy hoard
    map Cheer out 0.4 radius 1
end

# Books soak up the noise round them.
unitRule hush
    appliesTo bookcase
    map Noise in 1 radius 1
end

# The cistern drips, day and night.
unitRule drip
    appliesTo cistern
    map Damp out 0.6 radius 1
end

# A tame mimic eats a little of the provisions and, fed, purrs (in its way).
unitRule purr
    appliesTo mimic
    global Night atLeast 1
    global Provisions in 0.05
    map Cheer out 1.2 radius 2
    map Noise out 0.3
end

# ---------- production chains ----------

# Mushroom beds grow where the damp is 2 or more: one mushroom every four ticks.
unitRule grow
    appliesTo mushbed
    rate 4
    map Damp atLeast 2
    global Mushrooms less 16
    global Mushrooms out 1
end

# The still turns mushrooms into tonic for the bar while the doors are open, for a little gold.
unitRule distil
    appliesTo still
    rate 3
    global Night atLeast 1
    global Tonic less 6
    global Mushrooms in 2
    global Gold in 0.5
    global Tonic out 1
    map Heat out 1 radius 1
end

# The boiler heats water for the tubs, and steams up the room.
unitRule boil
    appliesTo boiler
    rate 2
    global Night atLeast 1
    global HotWater less 8
    global Gold in 0.3
    global HotWater out 2
    map Damp out 0.5 radius 1
end

# The boiler's fire burns all night, hot water wanted or not.
unitRule firebox
    appliesTo boiler
    global Night atLeast 1
    map Heat out 1 radius 1
end

# A tub in use steams a little.
unitRule steam
    appliesTo tub
    global Night atLeast 1
    map Damp out 0.2 radius 1
end
